Z||000003||BOSTITCH||11-23-1999||01:18 PM||||The factory sub didn't cut alone for me.  I put an eclipse deck 5341(I think) CD of course, diamond highs all four fr/Rear ran by 160 by 4 Rockford fosgate even replaced the factory sub with a fosgate I think 6.5? and two JL Audio 10w6's powered by two 50m's the ohm load isn't quite right though.  They are nicely cramed into the center console which its yet to be done but will mainly be bondo and wood plus a little a+b foam from home depot, and just in case anyone was wondering somehow I going to try some cup holders in there.||||reg||1
